# souxmar code ownership.
#
# CODEOWNERS assigns reviewers: an owned path puts its owner on the PR
# automatically. souxmar has one maintainer, so one entry says all of it.
# Adding per-area teams before those teams exist would make this file inert —
# GitHub silently ignores owners it cannot resolve.
#
# It does NOT gate merges. This file used to claim it did. Ownership only
# blocks a merge when branch protection sets `require_code_owner_reviews`,
# and `master` has no branch protection at all — see docs/CI.md § Branch
# protection. Even once protection is enabled, a single-maintainer repository
# cannot require code-owner review of its only author, so the merge gate is
# the two status checks named there, not this file.

